I didn't know you drank hot Americanos.

532
00:37:31,403 --> 00:37:33,360
There's still a lot you don't know about me, Kit.

533
00:37:35,285 --> 00:37:38,070
You'd better keep your distance from me.

534
00:37:38,769 --> 00:37:41,270
Who knows what else might come out about me?

535
00:37:41,723 --> 00:37:43,024
You'll only get dragged into it.

536
00:37:43,291 --> 00:37:44,880
Then that's all the more reason for me to stay close to you.

537
00:37:46,064 --> 00:37:48,840
How about this? I'll wait for you in the parking lot every morning.

538
00:37:49,131 --> 00:37:50,640
Then we can walk to the cafeteria together.

539
00:37:50,912 --> 00:37:52,200
And head up to the office together.

540
00:37:52,598 --> 00:37:54,240
As for lunch and after work,

541
00:37:54,622 --> 00:37:58,080
I'll pick you up at your department, and we'll leave the building together. Okay?

542
00:37:58,700 --> 00:37:59,701
No need.

543
00:38:00,035 --> 00:38:02,574
Even kindergarteners don't need someone picking them up like that.

544
00:38:03,331 --> 00:38:04,640
There's something else you don't know about me.

545
00:38:06,332 --> 00:38:07,960
I'm much stronger than you think.

546
00:38:16,694 --> 00:38:20,080
The cafeteria vendor refused to sell me coffee.

547
00:38:20,934 --> 00:38:24,560
Please tell Ms. Nopnapha that her plan to torment me worked.

548
00:38:25,140 --> 00:38:26,728
If I ever disappear again,

549
00:38:27,141 --> 00:38:28,808
you won't have to wonder why, Director.

550
00:38:31,374 --> 00:38:34,300
I have to go now. Someone else is coming to yell at me.

551
00:38:35,867 --> 00:38:39,632
Mutta, I have an announcement to make.

552
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:44,120
We, the Organizational Relations and Activities Department,

553
00:38:44,400 --> 00:38:46,101
have voted

554
00:38:48,707 --> 00:38:50,920
to expel you from our department

555
00:38:51,208 --> 00:38:53,480
to rid ourselves of this disgrace.

556
00:38:54,158 --> 00:38:56,080
By a majority vote

557
00:38:56,406 --> 00:39:00,280
of four to three. Please leave.

558
00:39:01,926 --> 00:39:02,927
Mutta.

559
00:39:03,830 --> 00:39:06,120
I voted in your favor.

560
00:39:07,224 --> 00:39:09,720
But we really were outnumbered.

561
00:39:10,958 --> 00:39:12,800
I'll help you pack your things.

562
00:39:15,112 --> 00:39:16,113
Don't bother.

563
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,001
I'm not leaving!

564
00:39:18,601 --> 00:39:19,680
How the hell am I supposed to make a living if I leave?

565
00:39:20,814 --> 00:39:23,128
And what gives you the right

566
00:39:23,955 --> 00:39:26,120
to kick someone out of the civil service?

567
00:39:26,440 --> 00:39:28,200
Because we've been affected

568
00:39:28,241 --> 00:39:30,360
by your disgusting behavior.

569
00:39:30,894 --> 00:39:32,640
If you had any sense of decency,

570
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:34,760
you wouldn't have waited for us to vote you out.

571
00:39:35,182 --> 00:39:36,560
You should've resigned on your own.

572
00:39:37,518 --> 00:39:39,480
What are you gossiping about now?

573
00:39:40,547 --> 00:39:41,548
Get back to work.

574
00:39:42,915 --> 00:39:44,360
Hear us out, Toey.

575
00:39:44,558 --> 00:39:47,600
We're having a dispute here.

576
00:39:47,760 --> 00:39:51,240
If a decision is made by majority vote,

577
00:39:51,718 --> 00:39:53,760
shouldn't we respect the outcome?

578
00:39:55,334 --> 00:39:58,440
According to democratic principles, we should abide by it.

579
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:01,640
Why? What's going on?

580
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:07,201
By a majority vote of four to three,

581
00:40:07,747 --> 00:40:09,600
we've decided that Mutta must resign.

582
00:40:10,574 --> 00:40:13,027
Please certify the results, Toey.

583
00:40:18,926 --> 00:40:21,512
So, who voted for Mutta to stay?

584
00:40:22,125 --> 00:40:24,392
The votes were almost evenly split.

585
00:40:24,589 --> 00:40:27,920
The voters are Hong, Chuenchom and I.

586
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:30,662
But we're still one vote behind, Toey.

587
00:40:35,462 --> 00:40:37,000
You can count my vote, too.

588
00:40:38,366 --> 00:40:42,000
Oh! Then that means the votes are now tied!

589
00:40:42,037 --> 00:40:43,842
Four to four!

590
00:40:44,024 --> 00:40:46,440
Mutta, you can stay.

591
00:41:13,144 --> 00:41:14,145
Uncle.

592
00:41:14,606 --> 00:41:15,607
What?

593
00:41:20,422 --> 00:41:21,423
I lost!

594
00:41:22,200 --> 00:41:23,201
What?

595
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:25,510
Here's the quotation for a mobile STI testing unit.

596
00:41:26,272 --> 00:41:29,200
I've selected only sexually transmitted infections, including

597
00:41:30,547 --> 00:41:34,179
gonorrhea, syphilis, HPV, and HIV.

598
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,001
Whoa!

599
00:41:40,416 --> 00:41:41,931
Why is it so expensive?

600
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:44,601
Look,

601
00:41:45,494 --> 00:41:48,118
there's no need to make such a big deal over just Mutta.

602
00:41:48,939 --> 00:41:50,240
I'll take her to get tested myself.

603
00:41:50,779 --> 00:41:52,107
That won't work, Uncle.

604
00:41:52,411 --> 00:41:55,000
It happened here, and the rumors spread here.

605
00:41:55,454 --> 00:41:56,800
If we take Ta somewhere else for testing,

606
00:41:57,160 --> 00:41:59,920
the people trying to frame her might claim the results are fake.

607
00:42:00,910 --> 00:42:04,400
Ta needs to be tested here to clear up any doubts.

608
00:42:06,467 --> 00:42:08,640
- But we can't afford it with this year's budget!
- Why don't you cut

609
00:42:09,078 --> 00:42:10,920
the overseas trip budget by about 3%, Uncle?

610
00:42:12,088 --> 00:42:14,400
We'd have enough money to test everyone in the ministry.

611
00:42:20,227 --> 00:42:21,440
Aren't you worried about her?

612
00:42:22,483 --> 00:42:24,240
Don't you realize that if we don't clear up these rumors soon,

613
00:42:24,453 --> 00:42:26,720
Ta will have to put up with this gossip for who knows how long?

614
00:42:29,301 --> 00:42:32,040
And frankly, this whole mess

615
00:42:32,325 --> 00:42:33,360
started because of you.

616
00:42:36,867 --> 00:42:39,250
You should be more proactive and take responsibility for it.

617
00:42:39,608 --> 00:42:41,363
You can't just act like it's none of your business.

618
00:42:41,454 --> 00:42:42,910
All right, all right!

619
00:42:44,024 --> 00:42:45,025
Approved!

620
00:42:50,192 --> 00:42:52,560
Damn, you didn't even give me time to feel guilty.

621
00:42:57,190 --> 00:42:58,191
Thank you, Uncle.

622
00:43:12,094 --> 00:43:13,095
Ta.

623
00:43:13,886 --> 00:43:15,000
I'm really sorry.

624
00:43:15,624 --> 00:43:19,000
I never imagined Nopnapha would go this crazy.

625
00:43:21,198 --> 00:43:22,760
But I haven't just been sitting around doing nothing.

626
00:43:23,512 --> 00:43:26,320
I've arranged for a mobile testing unit to come to the ministry tomorrow.

627
00:43:26,843 --> 00:43:28,640
So you can finally clear your name.

628
00:43:29,926 --> 00:43:32,040
I'll also issue an official memo to set the record straight.

629
00:43:32,430 --> 00:43:33,431
See?

630
00:43:35,286 --> 00:43:36,640
I really care about you, Ta.

631
00:43:39,168 --> 00:43:41,584
What if she spreads more lies about me?

632
00:43:42,464 --> 00:43:44,550
Will you have to keep clearing my name every time?

633
00:43:45,934 --> 00:43:47,091
And how am I supposed to live

634
00:43:47,992 --> 00:43:50,797
when everyone keeps looking down on me?

635
00:43:53,027 --> 00:43:56,840
I also warned her never to do anything like this to you again.

636
00:43:57,070 --> 00:44:00,334
Otherwise, I'll announce publicly that our marriage is in trouble.

637
00:44:01,272 --> 00:44:02,520
That's what she's most afraid of.

638
00:44:03,859 --> 00:44:07,000
But you shouldn't provoke her again, either.

639
00:44:08,323 --> 00:44:11,012
About me sitting on your desk, taking photos, and sending them to her?

640
00:44:15,528 --> 00:44:16,760
I love you, Director.

641
00:44:17,625 --> 00:44:18,726
Now that I'm back,

642
00:44:19,406 --> 00:44:21,523
I want to show that you're mine, too.

643
00:44:22,568 --> 00:44:23,569
Why?

644
00:44:24,211 --> 00:44:26,000
Is my dignity worth less than hers?

645
00:44:26,413 --> 00:44:29,680
Why do I have to hide while she gets to be out in the open?

646
00:44:30,230 --> 00:44:31,231
Or...

647
00:44:32,384 --> 00:44:33,800
Do you love me less than you love her?

648
00:44:33,835 --> 00:44:35,930
Oh, Ta. How could you say that?

649
00:44:37,296 --> 00:44:40,160
My love for you can't be measured or compared.

650
00:44:40,331 --> 00:44:41,640
Because you're the only one I love.

651
00:44:43,462 --> 00:44:45,200
As for Nopnapha, she's just

652
00:44:45,280 --> 00:44:47,881
someone I made the mistake of marrying.

653
00:44:52,400 --> 00:44:53,401
So...

654
00:44:54,664 --> 00:44:57,880
When will you divorce her and marry me, Director?

655
00:44:58,539 --> 00:44:59,760
You've given me the ring already.

656
00:45:04,384 --> 00:45:05,385
I've told you before.

657
00:45:06,806 --> 00:45:08,207
We have to wait until my children grow up.

658
00:45:09,307 --> 00:45:10,520
And when that day comes,

659
00:45:10,806 --> 00:45:14,080
I'll sign the divorce papers with Nopnapha in the morning.

660
00:45:14,432 --> 00:45:17,664
Then I'll register our marriage that very afternoon.

661
00:45:18,670 --> 00:45:19,671
Okay?

662
00:45:32,859 --> 00:45:33,860
I've told you before.

663
00:45:34,112 --> 00:45:35,440
We have to wait until my children grow up.

664
00:45:35,659 --> 00:45:36,880
And when that day comes,

665
00:45:36,971 --> 00:45:39,960
I'll sign the divorce papers with Nopnapha in the morning.

666
00:45:40,123 --> 00:45:43,000
Then I'll register our marriage that very afternoon.

667
00:45:44,432 --> 00:45:47,483
The speaker is trying to sound sincere,

668
00:45:47,600 --> 00:45:49,601
but is hiding part of the truth

669
00:45:49,766 --> 00:45:53,040
by making himself sound natural and convincing.

670
00:45:55,072 --> 00:45:57,350
You don't need AI to figure that out. Anyone can tell.

671
00:45:57,707 --> 00:45:59,400
To sum it up in one word,

672
00:45:59,440 --> 00:46:00,441
Bullshit!

673
00:46:00,863 --> 00:46:02,120
I can't believe it.

674
00:46:02,835 --> 00:46:04,880
How could my sister fall for a guy like that?

675
00:46:05,758 --> 00:46:07,500
Ta doesn't seem that stupid.

676
00:46:08,440 --> 00:46:10,360
Anyone can be a fool

677
00:46:10,441 --> 00:46:12,560
when they're blinded by love.

678
00:46:13,200 --> 00:46:14,700
You've read your sister's diary, haven't you?

679
00:46:16,854 --> 00:46:19,855
True. If I hadn't found Ta's diary,

680
00:46:20,294 --> 00:46:22,680
I'd never have known how that damn director manipulated her

681
00:46:22,795 --> 00:46:24,040
into falling so deeply in love with him.

682
00:46:25,792 --> 00:46:26,793
Listen to this.

683
00:46:29,651 --> 00:46:31,582
When I first started working here,

684
00:46:31,923 --> 00:46:34,104
I had to deal with some awful colleagues.

685
00:46:34,430 --> 00:46:36,627
But at least there were some good things, too.

686
00:46:37,310 --> 00:46:40,400
Like meeting Director Jenphop.

687
00:46:41,400 --> 00:46:43,840
You have 500,000 baht in student loan debt.

688
00:46:44,702 --> 00:46:49,200
And 3,150 baht is deducted from your salary every month.

689
00:46:50,000 --> 00:46:51,001
So...

690
00:46:53,976 --> 00:46:55,040
What's the problem?

691
00:46:57,699 --> 00:46:59,640
I'd like to request a payment deferral, Director.

692
00:47:00,504 --> 00:47:02,480
I have a lot of expenses right now.

693
00:47:02,718 --> 00:47:04,360
Once I've sorted out my financial problems,

694
00:47:04,451 --> 00:47:06,252
I'll resume making payments.

695
00:47:10,100 --> 00:47:11,101
But...

696
00:47:12,000 --> 00:47:15,520
The longer you put it off, the more interest you'll have to pay.

697
00:47:18,395 --> 00:47:19,396
I understand.

698
00:47:20,976 --> 00:47:22,360
But what else can I do?

699
00:47:23,787 --> 00:47:25,920
I really do have a lot of expenses.

700
00:47:29,787 --> 00:47:30,788
Actually,

701
00:47:32,059 --> 00:47:34,720
paying just over 3,000 baht a month isn't that much.

702
00:47:36,518 --> 00:47:38,640
I don't want you worrying about this.

703
00:47:39,136 --> 00:47:40,520
I'm afraid it might affect your work.

704
00:47:42,550 --> 00:47:44,000
How about this?

705
00:47:44,341 --> 00:47:46,502
I'll help you take care of your debt.

706
00:47:48,507 --> 00:47:49,926
What do you mean?

707
00:47:53,526 --> 00:47:55,088
I'll pay off your debt for you.

708
00:47:56,587 --> 00:47:59,046
There's something else I've learned about you.

709
00:47:59,678 --> 00:48:01,320
You're also struggling with rent

710
00:48:01,880 --> 00:48:03,400
since you had to move closer to the ministry.

711
00:48:03,731 --> 00:48:04,732
So, how about this?

712
00:48:05,464 --> 00:48:07,896
I'll help cover some of those expenses, too.

713
00:48:09,187 --> 00:48:10,720
I have a vacant condo unit.

714
00:48:11,480 --> 00:48:13,081
It's just three kilometers from here.

715
00:48:13,900 --> 00:48:15,101
You can stay there rent-free.

716
00:48:19,582 --> 00:48:22,400
- Are you sure that's okay, Director?
- Of course it is.

717
00:48:24,998 --> 00:48:28,680
Taking care of your subordinates is part of a boss's job.

718
00:48:33,723 --> 00:48:34,724
Thank you so much.

719
00:48:38,076 --> 00:48:39,077
Oh, by the way.

720
00:48:39,473 --> 00:48:40,840
I've read your background.

721
00:48:42,016 --> 00:48:43,600
You've been through a lot, Mutta.

722
00:48:43,963 --> 00:48:44,964
I admire that.

723
00:48:47,344 --> 00:48:49,240
Are you free this evening?

724
00:48:49,750 --> 00:48:51,080
Why don't you join me for dinner?

725
00:48:51,704 --> 00:48:52,960
I'd like to get to know you better.

726
00:48:55,438 --> 00:48:56,440
Of course, Director.

727
00:48:57,614 --> 00:49:01,080
I thought someone who treated me so well

728
00:49:01,395 --> 00:49:03,920
was the one I could spend my life with.

729
00:49:13,800 --> 00:49:14,801
[Free Health Screening]

730
00:49:16,320 --> 00:49:18,840
Come one, come all!

731
00:49:18,900 --> 00:49:23,601
Director Jenphop has arranged for a mobile testing unit to screen everyone right here!

732
00:49:23,840 --> 00:49:25,441
So you can all have peace of mind.

733
00:49:25,531 --> 00:49:27,760
If anyone tests positive, they can get treated right away.

734
00:49:28,160 --> 00:49:30,761
Don't be shy! Come get tested!

735
00:49:31,238 --> 00:49:33,160
Everyone, while you're waiting your turn,

736
00:49:33,227 --> 00:49:35,920
I have a critical illness insurance policy to offer you.

737
00:49:35,974 --> 00:49:39,400
HPV, for example, can lead to cancer.

738
00:49:40,262 --> 00:49:44,120
Whiskey, if I undergo gender-affirming bottom surgery

739
00:49:44,206 --> 00:49:46,207
and then develop cervical cancer,

740
00:49:46,379 --> 00:49:48,240
would the policy cover that?

741
00:49:48,552 --> 00:49:50,952
Then we'd classify that as testicular cancer.

742
00:49:51,928 --> 00:49:55,040
Actually, Whiskey, you should sell a policy to Aunt Phorn.

743
00:49:55,067 --> 00:49:56,480
Uncle Sak isn't here today either.

744
00:49:56,500 --> 00:49:58,680
At their age, maybe cancer's already gotten him.

745
00:49:58,710 --> 00:50:00,600
You bitch! Watch your mouth!

746
00:50:01,000 --> 00:50:03,001
Just kidding, Auntie!

747
00:50:03,043 --> 00:50:07,120
Actually, you shouldn't even bother getting tested for STIs.

748
00:50:07,190 --> 00:50:08,650
Because I heard

749
00:50:08,808 --> 00:50:11,809
your lady parts are covered in cobwebs by now!

750
00:50:15,214 --> 00:50:16,798
How vulgar! So low-class!

751
00:50:17,214 --> 00:50:18,720
I suppose you don't need to get tested either.

752
00:50:18,814 --> 00:50:21,700
You spend all your time with Cha-am, so you probably never change partners.

753
00:50:22,800 --> 00:50:25,022
Whoa, Auntie!

754
00:50:25,432 --> 00:50:29,256
I may be straight, but I still have standards.

755
00:50:29,832 --> 00:50:31,440
I wouldn't sleep with Meow even if you paid me.

756
00:50:34,080 --> 00:50:37,000
And I wouldn't sleep with Cha-am either, Auntie.

757
00:50:37,040 --> 00:50:38,041
But come to think of it,

758
00:50:38,075 --> 00:50:39,915
with faces like yours,

759
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:42,360
nobody would want either of you unless you slept with each other!

760
00:50:44,056 --> 00:50:45,920
Go on! Get out of the line!

761
00:50:45,957 --> 00:50:47,480
You're nothing but bad luck!

762
00:50:47,624 --> 00:50:49,825
You're in the way! So vulgar and low-class! Get lost!

763
00:50:50,200 --> 00:50:51,619
Come on, Auntie!

764
00:50:52,296 --> 00:50:55,480
Just because you're old doesn't mean you can insult everyone!

765
00:50:56,392 --> 00:50:57,880
I won't just take your insults!

766
00:50:57,960 --> 00:51:00,120
- Come on! I'm serious!
- Cha-am, go get her!

767
00:51:00,160 --> 00:51:01,700
- Oh, I'm so scared!
- Punch her in the face!

768
00:51:02,264 --> 00:51:04,840
Is that even a person? I never would've guessed.

769
00:51:04,902 --> 00:51:06,203
I thought it was a rat snake.

770
00:51:10,278 --> 00:51:12,635
You old hag! You've gone too far too many times.

771
00:51:14,083 --> 00:51:15,120
Why the hell did you slap me?

772
00:51:19,971 --> 00:51:20,972
What's going on here?

773
00:51:22,000 --> 00:51:23,566
Stop it! Stop!

774
00:51:28,843 --> 00:51:31,718
Stop it!

775
00:51:36,123 --> 00:51:37,124
Stop, please.

776
00:51:38,419 --> 00:51:39,800
Please don't fight.

777
00:51:40,414 --> 00:51:42,320
Violence is never the answer.

778
00:51:42,904 --> 00:51:43,905
Fine!

779
00:51:44,862 --> 00:51:45,863
Hey! What the hell?

780
00:51:48,288 --> 00:51:49,600
Why did you hit her?

781
00:51:50,539 --> 00:51:52,560
Phorn, you're old enough to know better!

782
00:51:53,835 --> 00:51:55,240
Why resort to violence?

783
00:51:57,427 --> 00:51:59,360
What's wrong with you people? Can't you listen?

784
00:52:00,685 --> 00:52:02,960
We all work together! Why are you fighting?

785
00:52:09,824 --> 00:52:10,825
The test results are in.

786
00:52:11,414 --> 00:52:14,720
Syphilis, gonorrhea, HPV, and HIV. All negative.

787
00:52:15,215 --> 00:52:17,720
Whoever's trying to frame me like this, stop it.

788
00:52:18,055 --> 00:52:19,056
It's pathetic.

789
00:52:19,094 --> 00:52:20,095
- We know!
- We know!

790
00:52:23,814 --> 00:52:25,160
You're still at it?

791
00:52:25,736 --> 00:52:26,737
Stop it!

792
00:52:28,192 --> 00:52:29,193
Hey, Phorn!

793
00:52:32,747 --> 00:52:33,748
Stop it right now!

794
00:52:35,334 --> 00:52:37,840
Whoever's trying to frame me like this, stop it.

795
00:52:38,240 --> 00:52:39,241
It's pathetic.

796
00:52:39,419 --> 00:52:42,760
Does she seriously not care that she's been exposed for having gonorrhea?

797
00:52:43,115 --> 00:52:44,116
Exactly!

798
00:52:44,587 --> 00:52:47,500
She doesn't even care about all the gossip.

799
00:52:48,400 --> 00:52:50,901
We even voted to make her resign.

800
00:52:51,235 --> 00:52:52,880
But she just said...

801
00:52:54,286 --> 00:52:55,520
I'm sorry.

802
00:52:57,144 --> 00:52:59,850
"I'm not leaving! How the hell am I supposed to make a living if I do?"

803
00:53:00,664 --> 00:53:02,010
That's exactly what she said.

804
00:53:04,648 --> 00:53:07,360
And now that they brought in a mobile testing unit,

805
00:53:07,523 --> 00:53:11,416
and her results came back negative, nobody's gossiping about it anymore.

806
00:53:59,500 --> 00:54:01,640
Here, take this. Keep the change.

807
00:54:04,558 --> 00:54:05,960
Thank you so much, ma'am.

808
00:54:07,890 --> 00:54:09,100
Keep me updated if you hear anything else.

809
00:54:10,000 --> 00:54:11,001
Yes, ma'am.

810
00:54:16,158 --> 00:54:17,159
[Bitch!]

811
00:54:20,589 --> 00:54:22,600
Director Jenphop has issued another official memo, ma'am.

812
00:54:25,891 --> 00:54:26,892
What does it say?

813
00:54:29,582 --> 00:54:32,400
He condemns the disclosure of Mutta's medical information.

814
00:54:32,942 --> 00:54:34,968
He says false information was used to maliciously target her.

815
00:54:35,070 --> 00:54:36,271
And that it's a criminal offense.

816
00:54:36,500 --> 00:54:38,760
He also attached Mutta's latest test results.

817
00:54:39,000 --> 00:54:40,001
They came back negative, ma'am.

818
00:54:40,600 --> 00:54:43,120
But Mutta really did have gonorrhea before.

819
00:54:43,638 --> 00:54:46,400
I got the information straight from her medical records, ma'am.

820
00:54:48,731 --> 00:54:50,608
But you told Phop about it, didn't you?

821
00:54:50,800 --> 00:54:52,401
Do you know he came and yelled at me?

822
00:54:52,411 --> 00:54:55,040
Oh, no! I didn't tell Mr. Jenphop!

823
00:54:55,200 --> 00:54:57,080
I told Veekit.

824
00:54:57,147 --> 00:54:59,000
And Veekit told Mr. Jenphop.

825
00:54:59,800 --> 00:55:01,371
It's the same damn thing!

826
00:55:03,779 --> 00:55:05,520
How am I supposed to trust you with anything now?

827
00:55:05,696 --> 00:55:08,200
One little flirtation from a man, and you spill everything.

828
00:55:10,814 --> 00:55:13,560
Please don't get upset, ma'am.

829
00:55:13,815 --> 00:55:17,040
Let's come up with another plan to deal with Mutta.

830
00:55:17,928 --> 00:55:20,782
Ma'am, the last paragraph says,

831
00:55:21,432 --> 00:55:24,920
While physical illnesses can be cured,

832
00:55:25,462 --> 00:55:28,320
those who bully and harass others

833
00:55:28,560 --> 00:55:29,761
must change their behavior immediately,

834
00:55:30,091 --> 00:55:31,702
as such conduct constitutes a serious disciplinary offense

835
00:55:32,000 --> 00:55:34,440
and will be punished to the fullest extent.

836
00:55:36,278 --> 00:55:40,145
A department director threatening a minister? Am I supposed to be scared?

837
00:55:40,483 --> 00:55:41,920
From now on,

838
00:55:42,307 --> 00:55:44,443
I won't attend any public events with you.

839
00:55:45,278 --> 00:55:47,211
And I'll announce to the media

840
00:55:47,760 --> 00:55:51,000
that you and I are no longer husband and wife.

841
00:55:59,800 --> 00:56:00,801
Oshi!

842
00:56:04,120 --> 00:56:06,121
What am I going to do about that bitch?

843
00:56:16,576 --> 00:56:18,480
Ever since the new memo came out

844
00:56:18,707 --> 00:56:20,704
along with Ta's test results,

845
00:56:20,875 --> 00:56:22,667
people have finally stopped staring at us.

846
00:56:23,900 --> 00:56:26,040
Then you don't have to walk with me anymore, Kit.

847
00:56:26,250 --> 00:56:28,640
My two friends are back to walking with me now.

848
00:56:29,078 --> 00:56:31,400
Oh, come on, Ta!

849
00:56:31,500 --> 00:56:34,201
Kit can still walk with us.

850
00:56:34,280 --> 00:56:35,840
The more friends, the merrier.

851
00:56:35,984 --> 00:56:38,040
We're all besties here.

852
00:56:41,979 --> 00:56:44,900
Oh! What are the police doing here?

853
00:56:49,184 --> 00:56:52,000
She seems awfully proud of the ring Phop gave her.

854
00:56:56,163 --> 00:56:58,640
When there should only be one ring like it,

855
00:57:00,622 --> 00:57:02,360
and it should be on my finger.

856
00:57:04,323 --> 00:57:06,124
Then let's use that ring

857
00:57:06,904 --> 00:57:07,905
to hurt her.

858
00:57:09,500 --> 00:57:12,720
Make her suffer so much she'll never dare wear it again.

859
00:57:18,600 --> 00:57:19,601
Hello.

860
00:57:20,601 --> 00:57:22,300
You're Mutta Jongsawat, correct?

861
00:57:23,446 --> 00:57:24,447
Yes.

862
00:57:24,672 --> 00:57:25,673
Good.

863
00:57:28,515 --> 00:57:30,840
Touch, call the police inspector for me.

864
00:57:32,216 --> 00:57:34,040
I'll teach that bitch a lesson.

865
00:57:34,376 --> 00:57:35,960
A pathetic mistress like her

866
00:57:36,680 --> 00:57:38,081
has messed with the wrong woman.

867
00:57:38,800 --> 00:57:39,801
Yes, ma'am.

868
00:57:47,374 --> 00:57:49,560
May I see both your hands, please?

869
00:57:54,131 --> 00:57:55,320
Officer, is something wrong?

870
00:57:55,544 --> 00:57:57,600
You've been accused of stealing this ring.

871
00:57:58,323 --> 00:58:01,200
That's an offense under Section 334 of the Criminal Code.

872
00:58:02,046 --> 00:58:03,280
Please come with us to the police station.

873
00:58:03,939 --> 00:58:06,760
Hong, aren't they two different rings?

874
00:58:07,040 --> 00:58:08,441
Remember when they fought outside the ministry?

875
00:58:08,600 --> 00:58:10,601
It was because Ta had a ring just like hers.

876
00:58:12,848 --> 00:58:15,819
Then would you dare testify for Ta, Whiskey?

877
00:58:45,184 --> 00:58:48,480
Ms. Nopnapha's asset declaration

878
00:58:48,571 --> 00:58:50,600
clearly specifies the details of the ring.

879
00:58:51,083 --> 00:58:52,360
And this is the diamond certificate.

880
00:58:52,944 --> 00:58:53,945
What about yours?

881
00:58:54,432 --> 00:58:56,440
How could you bully her like that?

882
00:58:56,656 --> 00:58:58,651
Ta is just a petite woman, Nopnapha!

883
00:58:58,720 --> 00:59:00,240
Don't you dare! Hey!

884
00:59:00,550 --> 00:59:02,880
You think you're the only one who can go crazy? I can be crazy too!

885
00:59:04,982 --> 00:59:07,000
Then let's keep living like this, damn it!

886
00:59:07,500 --> 00:59:09,640
Director, please calm down.

887
00:59:09,688 --> 00:59:10,689
I've missed you so much, Ta.

888
00:59:11,500 --> 00:59:13,100
I'm going to give it to you good today.

889
00:59:14,318 --> 00:59:15,480
Just to make things more exciting.

890
00:59:16,840 --> 00:59:20,080
Wait for me, Director.

891
00:59:22,192 --> 00:59:25,280
This is going to be so much fun, Nopnapha will scream!
